<title>USA: Altera names Denis Berlan COO.</title>
<headline>Altera names Denis Berlan COO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Altera Corp said on Wednesday Denis Berlan was promoted to executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to say who he replaced.</p>
</text>
